---
import { altosAIContactInfo } from "~/data/altos-ai";
---

<section id="contato" class="bg-[#FAFCFD] py-24 lg:py-32" aria-label="Contato">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-20">
    <!-- Dark rounded banner -->
    <div class="animate-on-scroll overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] bg-altos-dark px-10 py-16 lg:px-16 lg:py-20">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between">
        <!-- Left: text -->
        <div class="lg:max-w-[540px]">
          <h2
            class="font-[var(--font-jakarta)] text-[40px] font-extrabold leading-tight text-white"
          >
            Pronto para construir algo que
            <span style="background: linear-gradient(80deg, #5bbdcc 5%, #a8dce8 50%, #4a9ab8); background-clip: text; -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;"> realmente funciona?</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#E8F4F7]/55">
            Sem compromisso. Entendemos seu problema, apresentamos uma proposta clara e só
            avançamos se fizer sentido para os dois lados.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: CTA -->
        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-4 lg:items-end">
          <a
            href={`mailto:${altosAIContactInfo.email}`}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] bg-altos-teal py-[18px] px-11 text-base font-semibold text-[#0F2B3C] shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-[#4A8A9D] hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            Solicitar Orçamento Gratuito
          </a>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/40">Resposta em até 24 horas</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
